Carus Brom.wikitext:
{{AstraMilitarumPortal}}
[[Image:ColBrom.jpg|thumb|right|Colonel Brom as he appears in [[Warhammer 40,000: Dawn of War]].]]
'''Carus Brom''' was a [[Colonel]] of the [[Imperial Guard]] on the planet [[Tartarus]].

==Biography==
During his command, the planet came under assault and were overwhelmed by [[Orks]] under the control of [[Orkamungus]]'s [[Waaagh!]].  He struggled to contain the threat along with the increasing number of deserters among the ranks by the time the [[Blood Ravens]] [[Chapter]] arrived on the planet.  He did his best to assist [[Space Marine Captain]] [[Gabriel Angelos]] and the Blood Ravens until [[Inquisitor]] [[Mordecai Toth]] arrived and overruled his authority.{{Fn|1}}

==Fate==
*In the game, his fate remains unknown, though in the [[Dawn of War (Novel)|novelization]] he succumbs to [[Chaos]] and is killed after attacking Gabriel.{{Fn|2}}
*In the [[Eldar]] ending sequence of [[Dawn of War: Soulstorm]], his in-game model is used to represent the new commander of the Imperial Guard in the [[Kaurava]] system.{{Fn|3}}

