{{CrimsonFistsPortal}}
{{DeathwatchPortal}}
'''Casella''' was a [[Space Marines|Space Marine]] of the [[Deathwatch]], hailing from the [[Crimson Fists]] [[Chapter]].{{Fn|1}}

Casella was one of the Deathwatch Marines aboard the [[Strike Cruiser]] ''[[Incontrovertible Truth]]'' when it was ambushed by ships of the [[Black Legion]]. As the [[Chaos Space Marine]]s crippled and boarded the vessel, Casella was one of a group of Marines who were prevented from joining [[Watch Captain]] [[Gharvil]] in repelling the boarders by damage to the ship. Instead, Casella and the Marines with him attempted to set ambushes of their own in order to bring down the invaders.{{Fn|1}}

Although the Deathwatch Marines were able to kill a number of Chaos Marines, Casella was severely wounded and three of his teammates were killed. Casella, recognising that he was going to die and not wanting to hinder his Battle-Brother, sacrificed himself to allow [[Antor Delassio]] to escape.{{Fn|1}}

