Cassa.wikitext:
{{AstraMilitarumPortal}}
'''Cassa''' was an [[Astra Militarum]] [[Imperial Guard Lieutenant|Lieutenant]] in the [[Mordian Iron Guard]], who was stationed aboard the [[Void Station]] [[Solemnity's Might]], during the [[Invasion of the Stygius Sector]].{{Fn|1}} 
==History==
She was among the [[Mordian Iron Guard]]'s forces, that were dutybound to remain on their [[Homeworld]] to defend it from any threats. Cassa was lamenting this, as she went about her daily shift aboard the [[Solemnity's Might]], when the [[Void Station]] was suddenly destroyed by the [[Thousand Sons]] [[Sorcerer]], [[Khethos Vorsch]]. He had managed this, by summoning forth a spur of the [[Webway]] near the Solemnity's Might's location, which began the [[Traitor Legion]]'s attack on [[Mordian]]. However, the [[Chaos]] ritual that unleashed the Webway, turned the Void Void Station's remains into a nexus to everywhere and nowhere at once. As a result of this, its wreckage and the bodies of those stationed aboard the Solemnity's Might were scattered to other locations across the [[galaxy]]. Cassa's body was sent to distant [[Terra]], where it burned in the atmosphere of the  [[Imperium]]'s capital.{{Fn|1}}  

