Cassandra VanLeskus.wikitext:
{{ImperialNavyPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' (born '''Markha-Gher'''{{Fn|2}}) was an [[Imperial Navy]] officer.{{Fn|1}}

Named [[Fleetmaster]] of Crusade [[Fleet Tertius]] during the [[Indomitus Crusade]] by [[Guilliman]], {{PAGENAME}} battled the [[Khornate]] [[Crusade of Slaughter]] in the [[Sol System]] and continued into [[Segmentum Pacificus]] and [[Segmentum Tempestus]]{{Fn|1}} before meeting her end in the [[Pariah Crusade]].{{Fn|3a}}

==Overview==
Born into a [[noble family]] on the world of [[Vodine Sergastae]], VanLeskus is the product of generations of hard-jawed leaders of [[Human]]ity. She began her career as a [[General]] of its [[PDF]]. Over thirty years ago, she lost an eye in a [[xenos]] assassination attempt and now has a [[bionic]] one in its place which gives her a pitiless demeanour. Combined with her natural height and strength, she has cowed generals and entitled [[Groupmaster]]s of Fleet Tertius. Even before the summons from [[Roboute Guilliman]] when rumors of the Crusade fleets' organising began, she began strategising and organizing many within her senior command for the coming effort. Guilliman became aware of her activities and, satisfied no less with her record than with her ambition, granted VanLeskus command of Fleet Tertius. The newly appointed fleetmaster used her authority to recruit specialists who she knew would work well for her plans. These included intuitive logisticians, troubleshooting [[Munitorum]] agents and radical [[Magi]] Enginarium, as well as far less orthodox operatives.{{Fn|2}}

Her planning soon paid off, for she was able to quickly defeat a [[Chaos]] fleet which threatened the [[Sol System]]. Embarking on the Indomitus Crusade with five of Fleet Tertius' Battlegroups, she led assaults into the [[System]]s of the [[Machorta Sound]], absorbing stranded and beleaguered assets as she advanced. In the [[Battle of Machorta Sound]] she waged an extensive campaign across several light years against the forces of [[Chaos]]. During this first blooding of the Indomitus Crusade, she conducted intricate and simultaneous operations with a wide variety of forces at her disposal and scored an early decisive victory.{{Fn|2}}

During the [[Pariah Crusade]], VanLeskus led elements of Fleet Tertius at [[Paradyce II]] against a massive [[Necron]] fleet. Faced with a hopeless situation, her flagship [[Precept Magnificat]] was destroyed by a [[Pylon Ship]]. Fleet Tertius then regrouped under [[Groupmaster]] [[Athagey]].{{Fn|3a}} In the aftermath of her death, [[White Consuls]] Captain [[Messinius]] was made the new Fleetmaster of Tertius.{{Fn|3b}}

