Cataclis.wikitext:
{{OrdoMalleusPortal}}
Lady '''Cataclis''' is an [[Ordo Malleus]] [[Inquisitor]].{{Fn|1}} 
==History==
In [[M42]], she was part of an [[Inquisition|Inquisitorial Tribunal]] that was charged with determining if the execution of the [[Radical]] [[Helynna Valeria]] was [[Excommunicate Traitoris|just]]. Along with her two fellow [[Inquisitor]]s, [[Varrigan]] and [[Derval Bossch]], they brought Valeria's executioner, [[Katarinya Greyfax]], before them to explain her reasons for killing the Radical Inquisitor. Though the Tribunal was hidden from the [[Puritan]]'s eyes, such an investigation usually had its three members represent one of [[Ordo Hereticus|the]] [[Ordo Malleus|three]] [[Ordo Xenos|major]] Ordos. Because of this, Greyfax was able to correctly guess the Tribunal's identities, due to various observations she had made. After identifying the Ordo Xenos [[Inquisitor Lord]] Varrigan, Grefax correctly deducted that Lady Cataclis was there, representing the Ordo Malleus. The Puritan knew Cataclis favored using [[Mordian Iron Guard|Mordians]] in her retinue and Greyfax had noticed that several were in the hallway, leading to the Tribunal's room.{{Fn|1}}  

