Ceris Gonn.wikitext:
{{ImperiumPortal}}
'''Ceris Gonn''' was a [[Historian]] who was a founding member of the [[Order of Interrogation]], that [[Kyril Sindermann]] formed during the [[Horus Heresy]]'s [[Battle for Terra]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
They were tasked with recording the history of the [[Battle for Terra]], even as it still raged, and were given permission to go where they wanted. Gonn chose to visit the Imperium's forces defending the front lines of the invaded [[Imperial Palace]]. [[Kyril Sindermann|Sindermann]] told her this would be highly dangerous, but Gonn scuffed at this. She reminded him that with on-going invasion, no place in the Imperial Palace was safe for them.{{Fn|1}}  

==Sources==
*{{Endn|1}}: [[Saturnine (Novel)]], Part 1 - Chapter 4
