Cessio.wikitext:
{{UltramarinesPortal}}
'''Cessio''' was a [[Company Ancient]] of the [[Ultramarines 4th Company]].{{Fn|1}}

It is said that Cessio earned his title engaging [[Genestealer Cult]]s infesting the [[Hive City]] of [[Chanchados]] on [[Ponides III]]. Driven back to their last position, the cultist hordes threw themselves at the [[Ultramarines]] in a sudden counterattack. When the [[Company Ancient]]'s skull was cracked open by an [[Aberrant]]’s hammer, it was Cessio who took up the company standard before it could fall. With a great cry of defiance, Cessio rallied his brothers, and they smashed into the cultists. Still holding the banner aloft, Cessio met the cult’s monstrous [[Genestealer Patriarch|Patriarch]] in single combat. Yet with his dying breath Cessio lopped the monster's head from its shoulders and perished with the standard still standing.{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
*{{Endn|1}}: [[Codex Supplement: Ultramarines (8th Edition)]], pg. 15
