Chamberlain.wikitext:
{{BlackTemplarsPortal}}
'''Chamberlain''' is a [[Marshal (Black Templars)|Marshal]] in the [[Black Templars]] [[Chapter]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
The former [[Emperor's Champion]] has made a name for himself due to his tactical expertise. Many [[Crusades]] owed their victories to Chamberlain's talents, and he used them{{Fn|1}} in the [[Dark Crusade (Imperium)|Dark Crusade]]'s{{Fn|2}} [[Mont'shi Campaign]] against the [[T'au Empire]].{{Fn|3}} Numerous [[Xenos]] came to fear Chamberlain's approach,{{Fn|1}} though the Campaign eventually ended in failure.{{Fn|2}} While the [[Marshal (Black Templars)|Marshal]] was critically wounded in one of its battles, he was among those [[Imperials]] who survived the conflict.{{Fn|1}}
==Trivia==
{{Trivia}}
''Chamberlain'' was created for the [[Dark Crusade Campaign]], by the '''Hobby Center''' staff of [[Games Workshop]]'s '''Walden Galleria''' store{{Fn|1}} in '''Cheektowaga, New York, USA'''.{{Fn|3}}

