'''Cherris Draik''' was an [[Imperial]] [[Rogue Trader]] who discovered [[Jedathra]], the [[Fallen Knight World|Homeworld]] of the [[Chaos Knight|Traitor Knight House]] [[House Herpetrax|Herpetrax]], in late [[M36]].{{Fn|1}}

This occurred when the Rogue Trader was scouting an area of space, that until recently had been covered by a [[Warp Storm]] and word of her discovery soon reached the [[Imperium]]. Envoys were sent to invite Jedathra into the Imperium, but House Herpetrax refused their words and slaughtered them. The House then exclaimed that they rejected the [[Emperor of Mankind|Emperor]] and stated that [[Mankind]] will bow to them or be destroyed. This led Herpetrax to be declared a Traitor Knight House and the [[Astra Militarum]] and [[Imperial Navy]] launched an invasion against Jedathra. The Rogue Trader would take part in the campaign against Herpetrax, but it ended in disaster. Widespread mutation broke out amongst the [[Imperial Guard Regiment|regiments]] invading Jedathra and the Imperial forces were suddenly warned that a Warp Storm would soon fall upon the world once more. Draik managed to withdrew from the war zone, but messaged the Imperium that she had discovered evidence that Herpetrax had been conducting [[Chaos]] rituals on Jedathra for millennia.{{Fn|1}}

