Cilantro.wikitext:
{{EldarPortal}}
'''Cilantro''' is an [[Asuryani]] [[Warlock]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
He led their forces against [[Nardrop]]'s [[Ork]] hordes, after [[Freebooter]] [[Kaptin]] invaded an occupied world. However with his [[Mega Gargant]] and waves of [[Ork Aircraft|aircraft]], Nardrop had the initial advantage during the battle. Once the Gargant ran out of fuel, though, the [[Asuryani]] were able to stay out of range of its weapons, which greatly annoyed the Kaptain. When Nardrop discovered a mountain with coal he could use to refuel the Gargant with, however, he immediately left with a number of Orks to collect it. During that time, Cilantro learned the Mega Gargant was out of fuel and he gathered his forces to destroy it. However just as the Warlock began to do so, Nardrop returned with his coal and both sides are now racing towards the Gargant.{{Fn|1}}
==Trivia==
''Cilantro'' and [[Nardrop]] were created by [[Chris Quinn]] and they appeared in [[Firepower Issue 4]].{{Fn|1}}

