Cistrial Virn.wikitext:
{{DarkEldarPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a [[Dark Eldar]] [[Archon]].{{Fn|1a}}

Ruling the [[Kabal of the Falling Night]], they are a prominent power of [[Port Tavarr]] within [[Commorragh]] and a rival of [[Dhaemira Thraex]]'s [[Kabal of the Hollow Heart]]. When [[Orks]] under [[Ufthak Blackhawk]] were lured into Port Tavarr by Dhaemira, Virn, ignorant of the truth, entered into an alliance with her to combat the Greenskins.{{Fn|1a}} During the battle against the Orks, Virn was betrayed and stabbed with a poison blade by Dhaemira's brother [[Dhalgar]], but Dhaemira later gave him the antitdote so they could rule Port Tavarr together.{{Fn|1b}}

