==Overview==
In 005.[[M31]], the Order Secundii of Clan Aryeas, which was loyal to [[Horus]], carried the envoy of the [[Mechanicum]] [[Regulus]] aboard their [[Grand Cruiser]] to [[Mars]], in order to further the Warmaster's plan on the Red Planet.{{Fn|1a}}{{Fn|1b}}

