Claucus.wikitext:
{{BloodAngelsPortal}}
'''Claucus''' is a [[Librarian Dreadnought]] in the [[Blood Angels]] [[Chapter]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
Before his interment, Claucus was an [[Epistolary]] and was among the [[Blood Angels]]' forces that took part{{Fn|1}} in the [[Dark Crusade (Imperium)|Dark Crusade]]'s{{Fn|2}} [[Mont'shi Campaign]]. The Campaign was launched against the [[T'au Empire]],{{Fn|3}} which had begun invading [[Imperial]] [[Sector]]s near the [[Damocles Gulf]], in order to increase its territory.{{Fn|2}} Claucus has long been a proponent of strict anti-[[Xenos]] polices and it was the T'au's invasions that caused the Blood Angels to finally give the Epistolary one of its [[Battle Companies]] to command. He was then charged with putting down the T'au's [[Greater Good|heresies]] that had overtaken many of the Imperium's [[Colony World|colonies]], in the regions the Xenos had invaded. However, Claucus was later gravely injured in battle with the T'au and had to be placed within a [[Librarian Dreadnought]] afterwards. Once he had recovered, Claucus continued to fight the Xenos' forces.{{Fn|1}} Though the Mont'shi Campaign eventually ended in failure,{{Fn|2}} Claucus survived the Crusade.{{Fn|1}}
==Trivia==
{{Trivia}}
''Claucus'' was created for the [[Dark Crusade Campaign]], by the '''Hobby Center''' staff of [[Games Workshop]]'s '''Potomac Mills''' store{{Fn|1}} in '''Prince William, Virginia, USA'''.{{Fn|3}}

