Commodus (Chapter Master).wikitext:
{{SpaceMarinesPortal}}
'''Commodus''' was once the [[Chapter Master]] of the [[Sons of Pertinax]], which due to its traditions was known as the '''Sons of Commodus''' when he commanded them.{{Fn|1}}


==History==
During his rule, however, Commodus attempted to subjugate an entire world to his will in [[M41]]. This led the [[Inquisition]] to investigate the [[Chapter Master]] and the Ordos later declared him to be a [[Renegade Chapter|Renegade]] for his actions. Commodus' reign was eventually ended by a [[Callidus Assassin]] and the slain Chapter Master was succeeded by [[Pertinax (Chapter Master)|Pertinax]]. His heinous actions, though, tainted the [[Sons of Pertinax|Sons]] and the [[Chapter]] began a [[Penitent Crusade]], in order to redeem themselves.{{Fn|1}}

==Trivia==
{{Trivia}}
*The ''Sons of Pertinax'' and their history were created by [[Chris Birks]], when he served in [[Games Workshop]]'s official [[Outriders (Volunteer Program)|Outriders]] volunteer program. It was featured as an example [[Chapter]] for the UK [[White Dwarf]]'s '''Chapter Master Competition''' and was featured in [[White Dwarf 297 (UK)]].{{Fn|1}}
*''Commodus'' is likely named for [[Wikipedia:Commodus|the Roman Emperor Commodus]], who was assassinated in 192 AD and was succeeded by [[Wikipedia:Pertinax|Emperor Pertinax]].

