Conlan.wikitext:
{{Fanatic}}
{{SpaceMarinePortal}}
'''Conlan''' is a [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] in the [[Penumbra's Talons]] [[Chapter]].{{Fn|1a}}
==History==
He was once charged with claiming a [[Space Hulk]] and its technology for the [[Chapter]]'s [[Techmarine]]s. Conlan led two of the [[Penumbra's Talons]] for the task, which he oversaw from the [[Strike Cruiser]] [[Illustrious]]. However when the Companies attempted to purge the sleeping [[Tyranids]] the Space Hulk contained, the [[Xenos]] became aware of their approach and ambushed the Companies instead. What followed was a massacre, as isolated bands of [[Space Marines]] attempted to regroup and establish a bridgehead for the remnants of the Companies. This drastically changed the Penumbra's Talons' priorities and one of its Techmarines came up with a plan{{Fn|1a}} to destroy the Space Hulk, by overloading its reactors. Captain Conlan agreed with this and he traveled to the Space Hulk to take direct control of the Companies' remaining Space Marines. Thanks to his leadership, the Penumbra's Talons succeeded in their mission and the survivors managed to escape before the Space Hulk was destroyed.{{Fn|1b}}
==Trivia==
