Constantine Credo.wikitext:
{{NecromundaPortal}}
'''Constantine Credo''' is a [[Necromunda (planet)|Necromunda]] [[Rebel Lord]] of [[Hive Primus]]' [[Fallen House]] [[House Credo|Credo]] and is married to its leader, [[Lady Credo]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
[[Image:Lord Credo, rebel lord.jpg|thumb|right|200px|Lord Credo, last patriarch of [[House Credo]], [[Rebel Lord]]{{Fn|2}}]]
He was originally the [[Fallen House]]'s leader, but shared in [[House Credo|Credo]]'s continued downfall. By late [[M41]], Constantine was down to his last few credits and was living under a drinking hole in the [[Hive Primus]] [[Underhive]] settlement [[Two Tunnels]]. Both his fortune and House Credo's would suddenly change, after a mysterious woman introduced herself to Constantine however. They were soon married and he would then cede control of House Credo to his wife, [[Lady Credo]]. She had long sought to overthrow [[House Helmawr]]'s rule of [[Necromunda (planet)|Necromunda]] and used Credo's name to begin gathering allies and laying down the foundation for her rebellion. Constantine would aid her in this task and decades later, Lady Credo's work had created an army that was waiting to strike at her command. This finally occurred when the [[Great Rift]]'s [[Noctis Aeterna]] struck [[Hive World]] and an [[Assassin]]'s attack left its [[Imperial Commander]], [[Gerontius Helmawr]], in a [[Stasis Casket]]. With the [[Imperial House]] now weakened, the [[Credo Rebellion]] began.{{Fn|1}}

