'''Cordae''' is a [[Chaplain]] in the [[Raven Guard]] [[Chapter]].{{Fn|1}} 
==History==
He is one of the few of his [[Battle Brother]]s to survive the spiritual journey to the soaring [[Diagothian Mountains]] of [[Kiavahr]]. Cordae is even one of the fewer of the [[Raven Guard]]'s [[Chaplain]]s to return to the [[Ravenspire]] with a [[Roc]], after undergoing the ritual hunt to kill one of the ferocious birds. They are sacred to the [[Chapter]] and dwell on the Diagothian Mountains, where Cordae killed one with his bare hands as is required by the ritual hunt. After completing the ritual, Cordae then applied the bird's bones to his [[power armor]]. Like the rest of the [[Raven Guard]]'s Chaplains, Cordae believes adorning a Roc's bones allows them to carry its spirit with them into combat. They also believe, that doing so will ensure the Chaplains can properly guide their [[Battle Brother|Brothers]] into battle.{{Fn|1}} This has greatly helped Cordae, as he aided the [[Space Marine Company|Company]] of [[Shadow Captain]] [[Aremis Koryn]] during their battle against the [[Empyrion's Blight]] [[Chaos Warband|Warband]] in the [[Sargassion Reach]].{{Fn|2}}
