Corlhann.wikitext:
{{EldarPortal}}
'''Corlhann''' is an [[Asuryani]] [[Farseer]], who is a sound tactician and resolute commander.{{Fn|1}}
==History==
He is a veteran of many of his [[Craftworld]]'s wars, which included Corlhann leading the invasion of the [[Imperial]] world [[Fenarias]]. However during the [[Farseer]]'s attack, the [[Dark Angels]] [[Chapter]] and [[Astra Militarum]] [[Regiment]]s arrived to save the world. As their forces clashed, Corlhann struck the '''Refinery 14''' factory, but the Astra Militarum arrived before the majority of his forces could deploy there. The [[Guardsmen]] then cornered Corlhann, until [[Fire Dragon]]s, led by the [[Exarch]] [[Leurian]], appeared and drove them off. Shortly afterwards, though, the Dark Angels attacked the Refinery and they are now close to striking down Corlhann.{{Fn|1}}
