Corus Redsmith.wikitext:
{{SpaceWolvesPortal}}
'''Corus Redsmith''' is a [[Space Wolves]] [[Iron Priest]]{{Fn|1b}}, who serves in the [[Wolf Lord]] [[Ragnar Blackmane]]'s [[Great Company]].{{Fn|1f}}

The [[Great Company]] would go to [[Kanak]]'s aid, after{{Fn|1f}} it was [[Fall of Kanak|invaded]] by the [[Word Bearers]] [[Dark Apostle]] [[Oriax (Word Bearers)|Oriax]].{{Fn|1a}} However when their [[Strike Cruiser]]{{Fn|1b}}, ''[[Thunderwolf (Strike Cruiser)|Thunderwolf]]''{{Fn|1d}}, neared Kanak, it was ambushed and destroyed by Oriax's [[Murder Class Cruiser]]. The ''Thunderwolf's'' wreckage crashed upon Kanak{{Fn|1b}} and Redsmith was among those who survived the landing.{{Fn|1c}} However [[Ragnar Blackmane]] was nowhere to be seen.{{Fn|1e}}

The Word Bearers soon began attacking{{Fn|1b}} the leaderless Great Company and the Space Wolves rallied under the leadership of [[Valgard Twice-Slain]]. As the Space Wolves' battle to reclaim Kanak from Oriax's Word Bearers began, Redsmith worked to maintain and repair their equipment.{{Fn|1c}}

