[[Image:Severax.jpg|thumb|right|250px|Corvin Severax battles [[Commander Shadowsun]] ]]
'''Corvin Severax''' was the [[Master of Shadows]] of the [[Raven Guard]].{{Fn|1}}

He was an enigmatic and mysterious figure, rarely encountered by the wider [[Imperium]], Even the Battle-Brothers of his own [[Chapter]] rarely saw him. However, he nonetheless made a name for himself, most notably leading the Raven Guard in fighting against the [[T'au Empire]] on [[Agrellan]] and [[Voltoris]] in the [[Third Sphere of Expansion]].{{Fn|1}}

During the [[Prefectia Campaign]], Corvin Severax would meet his end battling the [[T'au Commander]] [[Shadowsun]]. Thinking he slew the T'au leader, Severax had instead killed a decoy volunteer and was subsequently blown in half by Shadowsun, cloaked and piloting a [[Ghostkeel]].{{Fn|2}}

Corvin Severax wielded the [[Lightning Claws]] known as the ''[[Claws of Severax]]'' and the suit of [[Astartes Power Armour|Power Armour]] dubbed the ''[[Blackwing Mantle]]''. Both were taken up after his death by [[Aethon Shaan]] following his appointment to Master of Shadows after [[Kayvaan Shrike]]'s resignation.{{Fn|3}}

