Crowvek.wikitext:
{{AstraMilitarumPortal}}
'''Crowvek''' is an [[Astra Militarum]] [[Imperial Guard Captain|Captain]] in the [[Serica Twenty-Seventh]] [[Regiment]].{{Fn|2}}
==History==
It is among the [[Imperium]]'s forces that are fighting the [[Orks]] on the [[Death World]] [[Maypax]]. During the battle, though, Crowvek was ordered to lead a number of the [[Regiment]]'s [[Guardsmen]] to save the [[Catachans]]' [[19'ers]] [[Platoon]], which had recovered the [[Fragment of Typhus]] artefact. Using a [[Valkyrie]], Crowvek's group arrived at the ruins of a temple, where the 19'ers were said to be located. Just as they did so, they spotted the Catachans about to be attacked by a horde of Orks. Acting quickly, the Serica deployed and began attacking the Orks, while Crowvek told the 19'ers' Captain, [[Obdant]], that they were there to save the Platoon and the Fragment. They then aided the 19'ers in killing all of the [[Xenos]], but afterwards, he was confronted by the [[Adeptus Mechanicus]] agent [[Jamona Hilt]].{{Fn|2}} He had been sent undercover by the Mechanicus to manipulate the 19'ers to recover the Fragment. Obdant had led Hilt and a small number of the Platoon to do so and once they had recovered the Fragment, he turned on them. However before Hilt could kill them, the 19'ers [[Ogryn]] [[Moom]] had attacked him, which allowed the Platoon to escape the temple with Hilt and the Fragment.{{Fn|1}} Now with the Serica there, Hilt ordered Crowvek to execute Obdant and the other 19'ers for treachery against the [[Imperium]] and for disobeying the orders of a superior officer. Crowvek refused to do so, as that was not among the orders the Serica had been given, but the matter was dealt with when Moom attacked Hilt again. The Serica then left aboard the Valkyrie with an unconsciousness Hilt and the Fragment of Typhus, which they would deliver to the Adeptus Mechanicus on [[Mars]].{{Fn|2}}

==Sources==
*{{Endn|1}}: [[Warhammer Monthly 67]] - ''The 19'ers - Part Four''
*{{Endn|2}}: [[Warhammer Monthly 68]] - ''The 19'ers - Part Five''

