==History==
Originally from a [[Questor Mechanicus]] [[Knight House]], Crucible witnessed something terrible while fighting besides the [[Dark Angels]] against the forces of [[Chaos]]. Life with his [[Knight House]] would be impossible to return to afterwards and so Crucible swore himself to the service of [[Space Marine Captain|Master]] Zephon and his task force. He would fight with them as a [[Freeblade]], until the task force's terrible duty against the servants of the [[Chaos Gods]] was done. During battles, the Crucible of Wrath strides into combat and valiantly defends the Dark Angels that are around him, from their foes. He now fights alongside two other Freeblade Knights, who have sworn the same oath to Zephon and together they are known as the [[Three Witnesses]].{{Fn|1}}

