Cules.wikitext:
{{SpaceMarinesPortal}}
'''Cules''' was an [[Iron Snakes]] [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]], who took part in the [[Sabbat Worlds Crusade]]. Prior to that, he was known for commanding his [[Battle Brother]]s to glory, against the traitors of the [[Yandine Drift]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
During the [[Sabbat Worlds Crusade|Crusade]], the [[Iron Snakes]] were victorious on [[Ambold]], [[Fornax Aleph]] and [[Presarius]], where Cules led them against their foes. It was after this victory, that the Sabbat Worlds Crusade's [[Warmaster]] [[Macaroth]] met with Cules and congratulated the Iron Snakes for their efforts. However Macaroth then told Cules that he planned to enact a new phase of the Crusade, which would require the Iron Snakes' forces to be separated. Their squadrons would now be sent where they could best aid, the Warmaster's battle plans.{{Fn|1}}

