Cyarro.wikitext:
{{InquisitionPortal}} 
'''Cyarro''' is an [[Inquisitor]] who took part in the [[13th Black Crusade]].{{Fn|1}}

He serves in the [[Inquisition]]'s fortress on [[Nemesis Tessera]] and aided in its defense, when the [[Heretic]] [[Inquisitor]] [[Van Hel]], opened a [[Warp Rift]] in the fortress' bowls. As this was happening, a large force of [[Chaos Space Marines]] appeared and attacked Nemesis Tessera as well. Thus it was revealed that the forces of [[Chaos]] were behind Van Hel's actions and their target was the Inquisition's fortress. However, the world would have been destroyed by the Rift, were it not for Cyarro's heroic actions. Thanks to him, the Warp Rift was closed and Van Hel's treachery against the [[Imperium]] was ended. Cyarro then joined Nemesis Tessera's surviving Inquisitors in defending their besieged fortress. But with the aid of the [[Space Wolves]], the Chaos Space Marines were defeated and Nemesis Tessera's fortress was saved.{{Fn|1}}

