Cytha.wikitext:
{{ImperiumPortal}}
'''Cytha''' was a member of a pro-[[Imperium]] resistance cell led by [[Malya L'nor]] that opposed the [[Daemon Prince]] [[Kernax Voldorius|Voldorius]] when he subjugated the planet [[Quintus]].{{Fn|1}}

Cytha was selected by [[Makaal]] as part of his mission to assassinate Voldorius. Infiltrating the Daemon's citadel in [[Mankarra]], the team attempted to sabotage the [[teleportarium]] as Voldorius was using it. They managed to rig the teleportarium with explosives which detonated as the Daemon Prince emerged from it, opening a [[warp rift]]. Unfortunately, not only did Voldorius survive the attempt, but Cytha, [[Bys]] and [[Rund]] were sucked through the rift, destroying their souls.{{Fn|1}}

