D'vok.wikitext:
{{BlackLegionPortal}}
[[Image:D'vok vs Ghaelyn.jpg|thumb|right|250px|[[D'vok]]{{Fn|1}} and [[Ghaelyn]]'s{{Fn|2}} forces clash on [[Daethe]].{{Fn|3}}]]
'''D'vok the Unmaker''' is a [[Warpsmith]] of the [[Black Legion]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
He was formerly of the [[Iron Warriors]] [[Legion]], until the [[Warpsmith]]'s scheming led to a schism within his [[Chaos Warband|Warband]]. D'vok abandoned his former comrades afterwards, with his most elite followers and packs of [[Daemon Engines]], to form the [[Forgeborn (Warband)|Forgeborn]], which he commanded. The Warpsmith then had his new Warband join the [[Black Legion]].{{Fn|3}}

===Vigilus===
D'vok and his forces have launched an invasion on the [[Exodite]] world [[Daethe]] in the [[Nachmund Gauntlet]]{{Fn|1}}. He hopes to harvest its [[World Spirit]]'s soul energy, to both supercharge his [[Daemon Engine]]s and curry favor with the [[Black Legion]]'s [[Warmaster]], [[Abaddon]]{{Fn|3}}. He is being opposed, however, by the [[Saim-Hann]] [[Autarch]] [[Ghaelyn]], who has come to Daethe's aid with her [[Craftworld]]'s forces.{{Fn|2}}

