Dacia (Ultramarines).wikitext:
{{UltramarinesPortal}}
'''Dacia''' was a [[Veteran Sergeant]] in the [[Ultramarines]] [[Chapter|Chapter's]] rebuilt [[1st Company (Ultramarines)|First Company]], following its destruction by [[Hive Fleet Behemoth]] in the [[Battle for Macragge]].{{Fn|1a}}

After joining the First Company, Dacia took part in the successful defense of [[Ichar IV]] from [[Hive Fleet Kraken]] and later prepared to defend the [[Imperium|Imperial]] worlds in the [[Vortengard Spiral]] from an [[Ork]] invasion.  However, during their journey there, the Chapter received word that the [[Agri World]] [[Styxia Prime]] had been invaded by a tendril of [[Hive Fleet Gorgon]].  Though the Chapter was committed to aid the worlds of the Vortengard Spiral, [[Master of Sanctity]] [[Ortan Cassius]] was able to successfully petition [[Chapter Master]] [[Calgar]] to aid the Agri World.  The Master of Sanctity was then charged with a one hundred strong strike force{{Fn|1b}} and Dacia was named as his second in command.  After the strike force joined the other Imperium forces defending Styxia Prime{{Fn|1a}}, the [[Hive Fleet]] was destroyed and afterwards the remainder of Cassius' forces joined their Chapter in the Vortengard Spiral.  For his efforts in saving Styxia Prime, the Chapter made Dacia the [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] of the [[9th Company (Ultramarines)|Ninth Company]], but he soon died during his third battle with the Orks invading the Vortengard Spiral.{{Fn|1c}}

