Damien 1427.wikitext:
{{OrdoHereticusPortal}}
[[Image:Damien1427.jpg‎‎|thumb|right|200px|The Arco-Flagellant Damien 1427{{Fn|1a}}]]
'''Damien 1427''' is a human male and [[Arco-Flagellant]]. His trigger word is 'purgatus' and his true name was expunged from [[Imperial]] records.{{Fn|1b}}  


==Biography==
It is known that he was once a peddler, who was caught in a rock slide on his homeworld [[Siluria IV]]. Damien survived, but suffered nearly fatal head injuries that led him to hallucinate that the [[Emperor]] now spoke to him. This led him to later become an [[Heretic|iconoclast]] and he gathered a heretical mob in the wilderness of the planet. Damien would use them to commit numerous heretical acts and sow dissent against the [[Cardinal]] of Siluria IV.{{Fn|1b}}

However, after he instigated a short-lived rebellion against the world's [[planetary governor]], [[Tyron Rex]], Damien was arrested and the judgement of Arco-Flagellation was passed on him. Since then, Damien has served several [[Priest]]s and even agents of the [[Inquisition|Holy Ordos]].{{Fn|1b}}

His current whereabouts are unknown, but there have been reports of a flagellant matching Damien's description seen serving the [[Inquisitor]] [[Rychus Blane]], in the aftermath of the [[Gharagdar Heresy]].{{Fn|4}}

