Damien Mordua.wikitext:
{{SpaceMarinesPortal}}
[[Image:DamienMordua.jpg|thumb|right|200px|Damien Mordua{{Fn|1a}}]]
'''Damien Mordua''' is the ferocious [[Jump Pack Captain]] of the [[Sons of Sanguinius]] [[Chapter]]'s [[Space Marine Company|Third Company]].{{Fn|1b}}
==History==
In his first battle as a [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]], Mordua fought a lengthy duel with a [[Bloodthirster]] until the [[Greater Daemon]] finally struck him down. Though he was left severely wounded, Mordua survived his defeat and went on to become as ferocious as ever. He has also developed a great hatred of the [[Aeldari]], due to the [[Space Marine Company|Third Company]]'s frequent battles with the [[Craftworld]] [[Jainas Shelwe]], in the [[Havaius System]]. The Company is now in the [[Lesterius System]], which is heavily infested with [[Orks]]. This has already caused Mordua to develop a great hatred for the Greenskins as well.{{Fn|1b}}
==Wargear==
Besides his [[Jump Pack]], Mordua also wields a [[power sword]] and a [[storm bolter]], that was taken from a [[Chimera]].{{Fn|1b}} 
==Trivia==
