'''{{PAGENAME}}''' was a member of the [[Thousand Sons]] [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]] who took part in the [[Horus Heresy]] and survived that conflict to continue to plague the [[Imperium]]. He later became interred within a [[Helbrute]] and joined many survivors of the Thousand Sons Legion in serving the [[Daemon Prince]] [[Vyrokan]].{{Fn|1}}

When the Daemon Prince ordered his forces to attack the [[Imperium]] city '''Valmar Magna''', Deathtoll took part and helped to destroy the city. However as the city lay in ruins, Vyrokan's forces later clashed with a [[Dark Angels]] task force and the [[Freeblade Knight]] [[Gerantius]], who had been sent to reclaim the city from the Daemon Prince. In the fierce battle that followed, Deathtoll was destroyed by a [[Deathwing]] squadron, ending his ten thousand years of bloodshed in the [[Long War]].{{Fn|1}}

