Decima (Dreadblade Knight).wikitext:
{{ChaosKnightsPortal}}
[[Image:Decima.jpg|thumb|right|220px|Decima]]
'''Decima''' is a [[Dreadblade Knight]] who pilots the ''Incarnate Slaughter''.

Once known as ''Incarnate Valour'', the murderous [[Knight Rampager]] and its pilot Decima fell to [[Chaos]] during battle as a  lance of [[House Merridon]], in which every last Knight of the household strove to halt the rampant advance of [[Hive Fleet]] [[Hydra (Hive Fleet)|Hydra]] that was fast approaching their world. The bold, final charge was doomed to failure due to being outnumbered by billions, each Knight was cut down and picked apart by the unending [[xenos]] swarms. ''Incarnate Valour'' was the last warrior standing, and in its [[Throne Mechanicum]] remained a single imperative – kill. It was at this point that a [[warp]] breach appeared beneath its feet, drawing the engine into the empyrean. Since then, ''Incarnate Slaughter'' has appeared on dozens of other worlds. Though it is primarily drawn to worlds infested by [[Tyranid]]s, the Knight Rampager will turn its rage on any enemy with which it is faced.{{Fn|2}}

''Decima'' is known to have appeared alongside the forces of [[Khorne]] in the [[First War for Armageddon]].{{Fn|2a}}

