==History==
In the wake of the [[Necrons]]' victories over the [[Imperium]] in [[M42]], Decius has said to let the [[Xenos]] gloat. While their conquests may let the Necrons think themselves victorious, the [[Space Marine Sergeant|Sergeant]] knows there is no corner of the [[Galaxy]] the [[Ultramarines]] can not reach. Even as Decius spoke, the Sergeant claimed the [[Chapter]] was retaliating by striking on a dozen worlds, against the Necrons. The might of the Imperium was also aiding the Ultramarines, which Decius ensured would allow them to claim their vengeance against the Xenos.{{Fn|1}}

