Delarique du Languille.wikitext:
{{ImperiumPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is an [[Imperial]] [[Rogue Trader]].{{Fn|1}}

After recieving a vision of doom from her [[Psyker]] servant that a doom from [[Vigilus]] that would threaten [[Terra]], du Languille suspected that it would be a [[Gellerpox]] outbreak and attempted to stop all shipping from the world. However, due to the chaos of the ongoing [[War of Beasts|invasions]] she was too late and a single vessel, the ''Illustrious Cargo'', had already left for Vigilus' [[Mandeville Point]]. Du Languille engaged in a frantic chase to beat the corrupted ship to the Mandeville Point. After catching up with the ship, she had her own vessel ''Messenger'' ram it and escaped to Vigilus via escape pod with a team of her finest followers. However, shortly afterward, she discovered that two more infected ships had left the meantime and were still headed towards Terra.{{Fn|1}}

