'''Demetrios''' was a [[Chaplain]] of the [[Scythes of the Emperor]] [[Chapter]], shortly before the fall of [[Sotha]]. He was part of the crusade force originally sent to liberate the reliquary world of [[Egottha]] in 990.M41, and appeared to be subservient to [[Hornindal|Reclusiarch Hornindal]].{{Fn|1}}

When the ''[[Xenophon]]'' was attacked by [[Tyranids]], it was Demetrios who called the Scythes to battle, under instruction from Hornindal, and witnessed the sergeants' final battle-oaths. He was last known to be leading the members of [[Certes|Sergeant Certes]]'s squad in a desperate counter-assault, before the ship was lost to the xenos boarders.{{Fn|1}}

Demetrios was known to be aggressive and hateful, and had a reputation for being less than kind to the Chapter's serfs. [[Milus Ogden]] noted that he carried an "ever-present threat of violence'.{{Fn|1}}

He wore a skull-faced helm as part of his [[power armour]], and carried a [[Rosarius]] and [[Crozius Arcanum]].{{Fn|1}}

