Demetrius (Firstborn Captain).wikitext:
{{UltramarinesPortal}}
'''Demetrius''' was a former [[Firstborn]] [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] of the [[Ultramarines]] [[Chapter]]'s [[8th Company (Ultramarines)|8th Company]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
He led the [[8th Company (Ultramarines)|8th]] in the [[First Tyrannic War]]'s [[Battle of Macragge]], as the [[Ultramarines]] fought to defend their [[Adeptus Astartes Homeworld|Homeworld]] from the [[Tyranids]] of [[Hive Fleet Behemoth]]. However after the Hive Fleet was defeated in space, the Imperium began aiding the rest of the worlds of the [[Macragge System]] that had also been invaded by the Tyranids. This included [[Ameton Epsilon IV]], which the [[Ordo Xenos]] [[Inquisitor]] [[Kryptman]] learned contained what would become known as a [[Norn Queen]]. The Inquisitor wanted this specimen preserved for study and so the bombardment of Epsilon's surface avoided striking '''Mount Antigonos''', where it had retreated to with other Tyranids. The Inquisitor then charged Demetrius with killing the Norn Queen and the Captain led the 8th and Epsilon's surviving [[Guardsmen]] against it. However disaster struck during the battle on the mountain, when the Norn Queen's death unleashed its [[psychic]] energy. The resulting impact against Mount Antigonos, caused its summit to collapse and only the 8th's [[power armor]] allowed them to survive the disaster. Demetrius would fail in his mission, though, as the Norn Queen's body was lost, after it became buried beneath the mountain's rubble.{{Fn|1}}

