Demetros (Captain).wikitext:
{{ImperialFistsPortal}}
'''Demetros''' was a [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] of the [[Imperial Fists]] [[Chapter]].{{Fn|1}}
==History== 
He led the [[Imperial]] defence of [[Zincali VI]] against a [[Chaos]] army led by [[Chaos Lord|Lord]] [[H'raxor]].  During H'raxor's invasion, he was also targeted by a [[Black Legion]] warband led by Captain [[Scaevolla]], who was hunting down the [[gene-seed]] descendants of a [[Horus Heresy|Heresy]]-era Imperial Fist named [[Aleph]].  Demetros was the latest in a series of Scaevolla's targets.{{Fn|1}}

Scaevolla and his [[Chaos Space Marine]]s broke through the outer defences of the city that Demetros's forces had fortified and the two Captains dueled each other.  Although Scaevolla wanted to lose the battle and finally die, having grown weary of his existence and of the [[Long War]], the [[Gods of Chaos|Powers of Chaos]] forced him to fight, and he would go on to win the battle and kill Demetros.  Demetros's skull was later incorporated into the [[Altar of the Four Gods]] on the planet [[Sebaket]].{{Fn|1}}

