Deren.wikitext:
{{SpaceMarinePortal}}
'''Deren''' was the [[Chapter Master]] of the [[Angels Numinous]], during the [[Kallius Insurrection]].{{Fn|1a}}

That campaign heavily ravaged the [[Angels Numinous]] and they were forced to ask the [[Blood Angels]] to aid them. Their [[Founding Chapter]], also suffered heavy losses, but were allowed to disengage after additional [[Imperial]] forces arrived. Deren would not permit his [[Chapter]] to do the same however. The Angels Numinous were the first to take part in the [[Kallius Insurrection]] and they would remain until the campaign was done. The Chapter had become so depleted, however, that the Angels Numinous knew it would take them a long time to recover to their full strength{{Fn|1a}}. Soon after the Blood Angels departed, though, they were ambushed{{Fn|1b}} by the [[Black Legion]]. Despite their current state, Deren sent the Chapter's fleet to aid the Blood Angels and saved their Founding Chapter from being [[Lost Chapter|destroyed]].{{Fn|1c}}

