Derval Bossch.wikitext:
{{OrdoHereticusPortal}}
'''Derval Bossch''' is an [[Ordo Hereticus]] [[Inquisitor]].{{Fn|1}} 
==History==
In [[M42]], he was part of an [[Inquisition|Inquisitorial Tribunal]] that was charged with determining if the execution of the [[Radical]] [[Helynna Valeria]] was [[Excommunicate Traitoris|just]]. Along with his two fellow [[Inquisitor]]s, [[Varrigan]] and [[Cataclis]], they brought Valeria's executioner, [[Katarinya Greyfax]], before them to explain her reasons for killing the Radical Inquisitor. Though the Tribunal was hidden from the [[Puritan]]'s eyes, such an investigation usually had its three members represent one of [[Ordo Hereticus|the]] [[Ordo Malleus|three]] [[Ordo Xenos|major]] Ordos. Because of this, Greyfax was able to correctly guess the Tribunal's identities, due to various observations she had made. After identifying the Ordo Xenos [[Inquisitor Lord]] Varrigan and the Ordo Malleus Inquisitor Cataclis, Grefax correctly deducted that Bossch was there, representing the Ordo Hereticus. He hated Greyfax and she knew if there was a chance to hurt her, Bossch would take it.{{Fn|1}}  

