Devarlin.wikitext:
{{ImperialFistsPortal}}
'''Devarlin''' was a member of the [[Imperial Fists]] [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]], who took part in the [[Horus Heresy]]'s [[Siege of Terra]].{{Fn|1a}}
==History==
He would be among the [[Imperial]] forces that were outside of the [[Imperial Palace]]'s [[Eternity Gate (Imperial)|Eternity Gate]], when it was closed near the end of the [[Siege of Terra|Siege]]. Afterwards, Devarlin commanded assault squad teams, within the [[Imperial Fists]] that were led by [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] [[Fafnir Rann]]. While they continued to hold their own against the [[Traitor]]s, the Captain's forces were nearly killed after a surprise attack by a [[Daemon]], disrupted Rann's battle plans. His efforts to hold a position against an oncoming horde were lost because of this and the Captain's forces were only saved due to an intervention by Commander [[Archamus II]]. With the aid of the much larger Imperial force, of Imperial Fists and [[Blood Angels]], the horde was defeated and Rann's forces then joined with the Commander's{{Fn|1a}}. Devarlin would take part in further battles with Archamus' forces, which included defending the Palace's '''Delphine Viaduct'''.{{Fn|1b}}   

==Sources==
