Dewr.wikitext:
{{TanithPortal}}
'''Dewr''' was a [[Imperial Guard Scout|Scout]] of the [[Tanith First and Only]] [[Imperial Guard Regiment|regiment]].{{Fn|1}}


==Biography==
Prior to the Founding of the [[Tanith Regiments]], Dewr was a hunter who worked in the gamelands south of [[Tanith Attica]]. Due to this experience with hunting and tracking, he was assigned to the Tanith scout corps.{{Fn|1}}

In the [[Sabbat Worlds Crusade]], while the Tanith First were deployed on [[Ramillies 268-43]], Dewr was killed by the planet's native wildlife. While operating alongside [[Sergeant (Imperial Guard)|Scout-Sergeant]] [[Mkoll]] tracking an [[Chaos Dreadnought|enemy walker]] through a fern-forest, the two found the body of [[Rafel|another Tanith scout]]. The fallen scout's [[vox]] disturbed a thorn bush that shot Dewr with a poisoned spine. While Mkoll was attempting to treat the wound, Dewr spotted the walker and inadvertently cried out, allowing the Dreadnought to locate and incinerate him with its [[plasma cannon]].{{Fn|1}}

