{{ImperialFistsPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' was a [[Huscarl]] of the [[Imperial Fists]] during the [[Great Crusade]] and [[Horus Heresy]].{{Fn|1}}

During the [[Siege of Terra]], Diamantis took part in the ambush against the [[Sons of Horus]] beneath the [[Saturnine Gate]] and worked alongside [[Mistress Tacticae]] [[Katarin Elg]] in identifying their locations. During this time he noticed an issue with the pumps that were handled by [[Arkhan Land]]. Diamantis went to investigate and was in time to save Land from the infiltrator [[Horus Aximand]].{{Fn|1}} Following the fall of the [[Bhab Bastion]], Diamantis led the Huscarls alongside [[Rogal Dorn]] in the teleportation assault board ''[[Vengeful Spirit]]''.{{Fn|2}} While Dorn became trapped in a seemingly endless desert of [[Khorne]] for untold mortal lifetimes, the status of Diamantis and his warriors was unknown. Their fate only was revealed after Dorn escaped thanks to the aid of the [[Emperor]], with the Primarch discovering Diamantis and the rest of the Huscarls bodies within the [[Inevitable City]]. Having lost his own weapon, Dorn took up the Huscarls sword.{{Fn|3}}

