Dionor.wikitext:
{{IronWarriorsPortal}}
'''Dionor''' was a member of the [[Iron Warriors]] [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]].{{Fn|1}}

==Biography==
Hailing from [[Terra]], Dionor participated in many of the IV Legion's campaigns, eventually attaining the rank of [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]], serving in the 5th Grand Company of the 3rd Grand Battalion.{{Fn|1}}

When the IV Legion was reunited with their [[primarch]], [[Perturabo]], the primarch issued an edict of decimation to purge the weakness from his Legion. Dionor's Grand Company was found wanting by Perturabo, with Dionor himself punished by demotion back to the rank of [[Legionary]].{{Fn|1}}

His Grand Company was deployed on [[Isstvan V]] during the [[Dropsite Massacre]], but only in the aftermath. When the bulk of the Iron Warriors were withdrawn from Isstvan, most of the 3rd Grand Company was left behind, although there is evidence that suggests that Dionor eventually rejoined the rest of the Legion and was promoted to the officer corps once again.{{Fn|1}}

