Djoseras.wikitext:
{{NecronsPortal}}
'''Djoseras''' was a royal member of the [[Necrons]]' [[Ithakas Dynasty]] and for a time the heir to its throne.{{Fn|1}}

==History==
Son of [[Phaeron]] [[Unnas]] and the elder brother to Lord [[Oltyx]], Djoseras saved his younger brothers life during Oltyx's attempted regicide by instead insisting he be banished to [[Sedh]].{{Fn|1a}} Djoseras did little after besides scribble scrimshaw on the bodies of his [[Immortals]] as the Ithakan court languished under the de facto rule of Vizier [[Hemiun]] and their mad father, who by now was succumbing to the [[Flayer Curse]].{{Fn|1b}}

Djoseras took his place at the throne of Ithakas for a brief period following Oltyx's flight to the world in the face of a massive [[Imperial]] [[Crusade]]. Overthrowing both Unnas and Hemiun, he led the defense of their crownworld of [[Antikef]] against the [[Angels Encarmine]] and [[Imperial Titan]]s. During the battle, Djoseras used a [[Tachyon Arrow]] to destroy one of the [[Human]] Titans in a single shot.{{Fn|1c}} Djoseras volunteered to stay behind and delay the Humans so Oltyx could evacuate the remainder of Ithakas and ensure the survival of their people. Alongside his Immortals, whose scrimshaw was revealed to be their names and deeds from their time as proud [[Necrontyr]] warriors, Djoseras died fighting.{{Fn|1d}}

