'''Domini Trista''' is a [[Human]] [[Champion_of_Chaos#God_Champions|Champion]] of the [[Chaos God]] [[Slaanesh]], who commands her own warband.{{Fn|1b}}
==History==
Little is known about Trista's past, except that she was once the '''First Mate''' on a [[Rogue Trader]] ship. This ship traveled the trade routes along the outskirts of the [[Eye of Terror]], but was last seen near the [[Cadian Gate]]. The ship was presumed lost with all hands, until Trista recently resurfaced as a [[Champion_of_Chaos#God_Champions|Chaos Champion]] of [[Slaanesh]]. Since then, her warband has gone on a rampage of hit-and-run attacks on worlds. [[Cadia]] and [[Tallarn]] are just some of the places Trista has struck, as she carves a bloody path across the [[Galaxy]].{{Fn|1b}} 

The [[Champion_of_Chaos#God_Champions|Chaos Champion]] has made a mortal enemy in the [[Asuryani]] [[Ja'Kleum Yrandi]], who clashed with Trista's warband on the [[Exodite World]] colony of [[Cirrus Prime]]. Yrandi had been a [[Craftworld]] [[Saim-Hann]] [[Striking Scorpion]] [[Exarch]] at that time, and had led a detachment of its forces to defend the Exodite World from the Chaos Champion. However Trista's warband defeated the [[Aeldari]] and laid waste to the colony, before leaving to search for more worlds to attack. It was assumed that every Asuryani and Exodite had been killed, during the battle, but Yrandi later awoke among the dead bodies littering Cirrus Prime. The enraged Exodite then vowed to track down and kill Trista and her Warband, in order to avenge the deaths of his brethren.{{Fn|1b}}  
===Chaos Abilities===
As a [[Champion_of_Chaos#God_Champions|Champion]] of [[Slaanesh]], Trista bears several [[Gifts_of_Chaos#Gifts_of_Slaanesh|gifts]] from the [[Chaos God]]. This includes the [[Mark of Slaanesh|Mark]] and [[Gifts_of_Chaos#Gifts_of_Slaanesh|Allure of Slaanesh]], along with being able to emit a [[Soporific Musk]] that causes those enemies near her to stumble.{{Fn|1b}}
==Wargear==
Her weapons include a [[Skull Whip]], a [[Shock Whip]] and a [[Laspistol]]. Trista is such an expert in wielding a whip, however, that her attacks can not be parried.{{Fn|1b}}
==Trivia==
{{Trivia}}
*''Domini Trista'' was created by the [[Games Workshop]] employees [[Jason Hill]] and [[Scott Hill]]. She appeared in [[The Citadel Journal 26]].{{Fn|1b}}

