Domitius (Dark Angels).wikitext:
{{DarkAngelsPortal}}
'''Domitius''' is a member of the [[Dark Angels]] [[Chapter]], who is the current commander of the [[Battle Barge]] [[Unrelenting Fury (Dark Angels)|Unrelenting Fury]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
It was part of the warfleet that served with [[Space Marine Captain|Master]] [[Lazarus (Dark Angels)|Lazarus]]' [[5th Company (Dark Angels)|5th Company]], as they defended the [[Imperial]] world [[Husk]] from an [[Ork]] invasion. The [[Unrelenting Fury (Dark Angels)|Unrelenting Fury]] fought the [[Xenos]]' warships alongside the [[Strike Cruisers]] [[Sword of Caliban]] and the [[Death of Mercy]]. While the Mercy later left to pursue the Orks' fighter craft that fled from the battle, the Fury and Sword remained above the world. The [[Battle Barge]] was then meant to destroy the invading Orks with an orbital bombardment, after Lazarus drew the Xenos to the 5th Company's location on Husk. However just as the Orks neared the Company, Domitius received an urgent message from the Dark Angels' [[Supreme Grand Master]] [[Azrael]]. It contained orders of the highest priority for the Unrelenting Fury, which required that the Battle Barge leave at once to fulfill them. Domitius immediately began preparations to do so, but informed Master Lazarus of his new orders before the Fury departed from Husk. However this meant the 5th would now likely to suffer heavy losses at the charging Orks' hands.{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
