Doriam Narathem.wikitext:
{{GreyKnightsPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' was the [[Grey Knights Grand Master|Grand Master]] of the [[Grey Knights]] [[Chapter]]'s [[3rd Brotherhood (Grey Knights)|Third Brotherhood]], when a [[Tzeentch]] [[Daemonic]] incursion struck the [[Imperium]] [[Fortress World]] [[Longhallow]].{{Fn|1}} 

Narathem would lead a substantial number of his Brotherhood, to end threat on the Fortress World in what was his fourth mission since becoming a Grand Master. It would turn out to be his last though, as he was struck down and killed by the [[Lord of Change]] [[M'kachen]], who appeared without warning on Longhallow. However, the Grand Master's death sent a member his Brotherhood, [[Aldrik Voldus]], into such a rage that he let loose a powerful [[psychic]] attack on the [[Greater Daemon]]. To Voldus' amazement, Narathem's sacrifice and the light of his attack, were of such power and purity that they were able to briefly guide [[Supreme Grand Master]] [[Kaldor Draigo]] from the realm of [[Chaos]]. Working together Voldus and Draigo proved to be unstoppable and they were able to defeat M'kachen and the Tzeentch Daemons, before Draigo was drawn back to the [[Warp]].{{Fn|1}}

After his death, Narathem was succeeded in command of the 3rd Brotherhood by Voldus.{{Fn|1}}

