'''Dorian Black''' is a [[Cadian]] [[Sergeant (Imperial Guard)|Sergeant]] in the service of [[Inquisitor]] [[Eisenhorn]].{{Fn|1}}

==Biography==
Black was born on [[Cadia]], near the [[Eye of Terror]]. Black was gifted at birth with a rare [[mutation]] that makes him a ''Psychic null'', or [[Blank|Pariah]], invisible and immune to [[psychic]] attacks. This condition isolated him from others, making him feel alien and alone.{{Fn|1}}

Despite his isolation, Black's physical prowess and determination earned him the rank of [[Sergeant (Imperial Guard)|Sergeant]] in the [[Cadian shock troops]]. His unique abilities remained unnoticed until a mission on [[Misril VIII]], where he survived a psychic attack that killed his squad, revealing his Pariah nature. Suspected of [[heresy]] due to his survival, Black was imprisoned until Inquisitor Eisenhorn discovered his true nature. Given a choice between death or service, Black chose to join Eisenhorn's entourage, where he has served faithfully ever since.{{Fn|1}}

