[[Image:Garus.jpg|thumb|right|200px|Dothran Garus{{Fn|2}}]]
'''Dothran Garus, the Falcon of Myr'''{{Fn|2}}, is a [[Tactical Marine]]{{Fn|1}} in the [[Ultramarines]] [[Chapter]], who has served for 77 years. He is currently attached to [[Jaenos Sevastus|Squad Sevastus]]{{Fn|2}} in [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] [[Anaton Thassarius]]'{{Fn|1}} [[2nd Company (Ultramarines)|2nd Company]].{{Fn|2}}

==History==
He was born on [[Macragge]] and as a child, Garus braved the wilds and scaled the world's jagged peaks without fear. He has since grown into a true son of his [[Homeworld]], who is broad of shoulder and strong of will. In battle, few men who have passed through the walls of the [[Fortress of Hera]] possess Brother Garus' talent for markmanship{{Fn|2}}. He is ambidextrous and is able to lay down deafening fusillades with his [[bolter]] and [[bolt pistol]] at much the same time. This skill earned Garus the coveted [[Marksman's Honour]] within a year of his induction into the Ultramarines{{Fn|1}}. However while he does possess all of his [[Primarch]]'s [[Guilliman|calm and pause]], within Garus' heart burns an ember of hatred for the [[Emperor]]'s foes.{{Fn|2}}

