'''Durlan Ocellati''' was a renowned [[Navigator]] who served the [[Space Wolves]] [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]], during the [[Great Crusade]]. Under his guidance, the Space Wolves' fleet reached the [[Wheel of Fire]], which they then [[Wheel of Fire Campaign|conquered]] for the [[Imperium]].{{Fn|1}} Chiefly known for his discovery of the only stable [[Warp|warp-route]] through the area of space known as the [[Wheel of Fire]]. He made this discovery in the year 981.[[M41]], and was shortly afterwards attached to the [[519th Crusade|Imperial Crusade]] assigned to cleanse the [[subsector]] of [[xenos]] taint. It is unknown if Ocellati survived this 5-year mission. The warp corridor he discovered was named after him - the '''Straits of Ocellati'''.{{Fn|2}}

